<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves rates unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves rates unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it left its draining rate, used to absorb funds from the money market, unchanged at 6.20 percent and its emergency lending rate steady at 8.30 percent.  </p>
<p>The central bank also said it was offering to inject 80 billion escudos ($474.7 million) of six-day funds to the money market in a variable rate repurchase pact, effective on Wednesday. Bids must be submitted by 1515 GMT.</p>
<p>The Bank of Portugal previously injected funds at 6.50 percent.</p>
<p>($ = 168.5 Portugese Escudos)</p>
</text>
